# === Misc ===
*.log
*.tmp
# Core dumps at the repo ROOT only — a bare `core` pattern would also match
# the agent/src/core/ module directory and silently untrack new sources
# (phase A2 caught daemon.rs/idle.rs/perf.rs already missing).
/core
/core.*
.core
